Student Enrollment & Course Management 
System (SECMS) 
User Story: 
The Student Enrollment & Course Management System is a comprehensive Salesforce 
application designed to streamline and automate the academic enrollment operations of 
an educational institute. This system enables administrators, enrollment officers, and 
instructors to efficiently manage student records, course offerings, enrollments, instructor 
assignments, approval processes, payments, and reporting—all within a unified 
Salesforce environment.
